## Throttle & Cost Control

- `.scout-lock.json` at `_SYSTEM/OS_KERNEL/` — per-scout timestamps
- Skip spawn if < 30s since last spawn for that scout type
- Skip on Read, Glob, LS, Bash returning <50 chars
- Skip if bus already has ≥3 unconsumed entries (scouts are backed up — wait)
- HERMES only spawns on Write/Edit (not Bash)
- Max 3 concurrent scout runners (check active PIDs via lock file)

