## Peer Communication Flow

```
CASSANDRA-LITE finds T7 path → writes HIGH severity to bus
  ↓ (30s later)
ARGUS spawns → reads bus → sees CASSANDRA-LITE HIGH finding → incorporates into context
ARGUS: "CASSANDRA already flagged T7 write; logic also shows this contradicts stated read-only scope"
  ↓ (30s later, next PreToolUse)
scout-inject.js reads both → emits to Claude:
  [SCOUT: CASSANDRA-LITE] [HIGH] Detected /Volumes/T7/ write path. T7 is read-only sync source.
  [SCOUT: ARGUS] [HIGH] T7 flag confirmed. This edit also contradicts the "local-only" constraint stated earlier.
```

